<h2 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1E293B; font-size: 20px;">Password Reset Request</h2>
<p>Hello<%= typeof userName !== 'undefined' && userName ? ` ${userName}` : '' %>,</p>
<p>We received a request to reset the password associated with your SmartConnect CRM account.</p>
<p>To choose a new password, click the button below:</p>

<div style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0;">
  <a href="<%= resetUrl %>" class="btn-primary" target="_blank">Reset Your Password</a>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748B;">This password reset link will expire in <strong>1 hour</strong>. If you did not initiate this request, you can safely ignore this message—your account remains secure.</p>
<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0; margin: 24px 0;" />
<p style="font-size: 12px; color: #94A3B8; word-break: break-all;">Button not working? Copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br /><a href="<%= resetUrl %>" style="color: #4F46E5;"><%= resetUrl %></a></p>

